    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to\u00a0Block Plop, a charming, relaxing puzzler. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick colors, plop down blocks, and capture territory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn but satisfyingly tricky to master, in Block Plop can you challenge friends in pass-and-play two player mode, or test your skills against clever AI opponents in single player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single or Multiplayer:</strong>\u00a0Play solo against AI or challenge your friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Colors:</strong>\u00a0Inclusive palettes designed  to accommodate all forms of color blindness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Difficulty:</strong>\u00a0From relaxing casual matches to impossible-level challenges, set AI difficulty to match your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monthly Themes:</strong>\u00a0Enjoy regularly updated visuals and music, keeping your experience fresh all year long.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Games:</strong>\u00a0Low match times are perfect for both casual and competitive play.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to\u00a0Block Plop, a charming, relaxing puzzler. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick colors, plop down blocks, and capture territory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn but satisfyingly tricky to master, in Block Plop can you challenge friends in pass-and-play two player mode, or test your skills against clever AI opponents in single player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single or Multiplayer:</strong>\u00a0Play solo against AI or challenge your friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Colors:</strong>\u00a0Inclusive palettes designed  to accommodate all forms of color blindness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Difficulty:</strong>\u00a0From relaxing casual matches to impossible-level challenges, set AI difficulty to match your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monthly Themes:</strong>\u00a0Enjoy regularly updated visuals and music, keeping your experience fresh all year long.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Games:</strong>\u00a0Low match times are perfect for both casual and competitive play.</p></li></ul>",
